=== Is the composition confound real? ===
HUMAN_OBSERVATION share: 54.8% to 99.8% across species
Post-2015 share:         28.0% to 89.5%
Spearman(reported, %human)  = +0.29
Spearman(reported, %recent) = -0.01
A strong positive correlation here means the confound is real and the
control below is necessary.

